# This repository publishes part of a larger working folder, so everything is
# ignored by default and the files and folders that are published are named one
# by one below. A new file in the working folder therefore cannot be committed
# by accident: it has to be added to this list first.

/*

!/.gitignore
# The marker every script searches upward for. Without it require_project()
# refuses to run, so a fresh clone could not run anything the README describes.
!/.project-root
!/README.md
!/LICENCES.md
!/LICENCE-MIT.txt
!/CITATION.cff

!/analysis/
!/data/
!/prereg/
!/public/
!/scripts/
!/tools/

# Clutter, at any depth inside the folders above.
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Four scripts belong to the writing of the article rather than to the study,
# and the repository publishes the study. They make the Word review copies of a
# draft, mark every change against an earlier draft, read the author's comments
# back out of them, and build the article as a PDF from a draft this repository
# does not publish.
/scripts/make_review_copy.py
/scripts/extract_review_comments.py
/scripts/build_article_pdf.sh
/scripts/make_marked_copy.py

# Two analysis files written as messages to the author rather than as records of
# the study. They stay in the working folder and out of the repository.
/analysis/coding-change-item.md
/analysis/findings-run02.md

# A blank worksheet for a second ruling that has not been made, and its key. The
# sixteen passages in it are published in analysis/coding/coders-differ-unprimed.md
# with both coders' answers, which is what a reader needs.
/analysis/coding/blind-reruling-sixteen.md
/analysis/coding/blind-reruling-key.md

# The working folder's own README, which describes drafts, reference and
# sources as well as the published folders. It is not part of the repository.
/PROJECT-README.md

# A copy of 48 sessions of fact-and-wording-01, made on 24 September 2026 by
# scripts/make_coding_subset.py so that the unchanged coders could run the
# Gemini coder's subset. The sessions are already published under their own
# run, so the copy stays out of the repository.
/data/runs/fact-and-wording-01-gemini-coder/
